   1169  f1fd							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1170  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1171  f1fd							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1172  f1fd							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1173  f1fd							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1174  f1fd							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1175  f1fd				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1176  f1fd							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
