   2068  f5f9							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2069  f5f9							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2070  f5f9							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2071  f5f9							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2072  f5f9							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2073  f5f9							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2074  f5f9							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2075  f5f9							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2076  f5f9							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2077  f5f9							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2078  f5f9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2079  f5f9				   CEH_Key
   2080  f5f9		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   2081  f5fb		       1d c4 f3 	      ora	EnemyBitTable,X
   2082  f5fe		       85 ba		      sta	EnemyDeadMask
   2083  f600		       a5 a7		      lda	LevelStartRoom
   2084  f602		       09 80		      ora	#$80	; KeyHeld = b7
   2085  f604		       85 a7		      sta	LevelStartRoom
