   2089  f607							; UEDispatch — the enemy-type dispatch tail, moved out of UpdateEnemies into the
   2090  f607							; $F82C pin gap (upstream of the $F8DD sprite pin, so the pre-pad END is
   2091  f607							; unaffected and the 15 B the folded chain frees stays free). Every non-raft arm
   2092  f607							; tail-jumps, exactly like the old inline chain, so the stack depth is unchanged.
   2093  f607							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2094  f607				   UEDispatch
   2095  f607		       29 7f		      and	#%01111111	; record byte = type|dir (b7): mask it here, at
   2096  f609							;   the single type-compare entry. 2026-10-22:
   2097  f609							;   a raft authored dir=right read $87, missed
   2098  f609							;   `cmp #ENEMY_RAFT` and its body never ran
   2099  f609							;   (no tide, no motion, no rider pin).
