   2651  f980							; CollisionEndY = bottom row, CollisionEndX = min col, CollisionCellX = max
   2652  f980							; col — cols are endpoint-mirrored above, so ALWAYS 0-19 here (no in-loop
   2653  f980							; mirror; bank2 display-space walkers add their own when they convert).
   2654  f980							; RectCount = running row, CollisionX = running col (both were walk temps
   2655  f980							; before — same ZP, no new allocation).
   2656  f980							; Exits: HIT -> jmp HotOverlapFlag (tail, C=1 contract preserved);
   2657  f980							;	  miss -> clc / rts. Stack depth during the walk = old walk exactly
