   2765  f9c1							;		     M1 one clock left of the [A-7,A] player contract).
   2766  f9c1							;		     ENAM1 latched #$02 for the whole cave (hero-style: 2
   2767  f9c1							;		     ENAM writes/frame — enable here, clear in .AfterRows);
   2768  f9c1							;		     walls hide the parked M1 in unpatched bands (PF > M1 in
   2769  f9c1							;		     the priority chain — convert enforces the solid cell).
   2770  f9c1							; Runs before the single HMOVE (HMP0+X shadow registers accumulate).
   2771  f9c1							; Sym path cost: jsr+rts overhead only — no RESP/HMP write, frames stay
