   2866  fa2d							; Phase 4 asym-patch collision overlay cluster — MOVED from bank2 to bank0
   2867  fa2d							; (repack chunk 4, 2026-10-20). One entry (OverlayTramp at $F9B8, inline
   2868  fa2d							; `jmp PHMOverlay` instead of a bank switch), three bodies, two tables:
   2869  fa2d							;   PHMOverlay / OvM1Block / OvShutBand   (ball strip → M1 strip → shutter)
   2870  fa2d							;   OvHead/OvTail (band edges), M1OffTab (MetaA b0 → side offset)
