   3337  fc8a							; jsr EnterRoom at SP=$F7, so the return address sat on $F6/$F7
   3338  fc8a							; (BombX/BombTimer), EnterRoomB2's `sta BombTimer` zeroed the pushed
   3339  fc8a							; PCH, and ReturnPad's rts popped ($00<<8|BombX)+1 = $009A -> ZP
   3340  fc8a							; executed as code -> $F008 pad -> GameStart REBOOT to title (the
   3341  fc8a							; SIM_EXIT=down f265 296-line crash frame + the title-264 family).
   3342  fc8a							; With the tail-jmp the slot count drops by one: EnterRoom's return
   3343  fc8a							; lands on $F8/$F9 (stack-only cells) on every death path.
   3344  fc8a							; The old post-code (vy/JetPower zeros + rts) was unreachable; DELETED
   3345  fc8a							; 2026-10-16 (intro music) — the $FDD8 blast-tramp pin below absorbs the
   3346  fc8a							; shift, so the twins stay put. DropArm zeroes vyLo/vyHi/PlayerYSub itself
   3347  fc8a							; (JetPower=4 stays through the drop-in flutter — identical to the .LLStay
   3348  fc8a							; path). LoseLife's `sec` still runs (DropArm's rts pops the jsr ReloadLevel
   3349  fc8a							; slot back into LoseLife).
   3350  fc8a		       4c 20 fc 	      jmp	LoadLevel
