   3797  fe0c							; 2026-10-18: keep the SOLID block and read it as
   3798  fe0c							; a trunk/log — the solid art also looks bigger
   3799  fe0c							; than the notched LAMP one, so the player lands
   3800  fe0c							; on it more confidently.
